  "question": {
    "text": "If the foot of the perpendicular from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the distance of the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> from the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>, measured parallel to a line with direction ratios <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>, is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "aEVvt",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2qpJb",
